     * {@link ArrayIndexOutOfBoundsException} or {@link NumberFormatException}.
     * Missing components are treated as {@code 0} and non‑numeric components are
     * ignored (treated as {@code 0}).  This prevents a maliciously crafted
     * version string from causing a denial‑of‑service crash.
