/**
 * Secure XML conversion utilities.
 *
 * The {@code toSAXSourceFromStream} method has been hardened against XML External Entity (XXE)
 * attacks. All known insecure features are explicitly disabled and the parser is configured
 * to reject DTDs. The method now validates its input and guarantees that a non‑null,
 * securely‑configured {@link XMLReader} is returned, throwing a {@link SAXException}
 * if a safe configuration cannot be achieved.
